---
title: The first five minutes
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor you as You
  participant hack as Hack
  participant engine as Compose engine
  participant browser as Browser
  you->>hack: hack init
  hack->>hack: Write .hack/ config
  you->>hack: hack up --detach
  hack->>engine: Start project services
  engine-->>hack: Services running
  Note over hack,engine: Shared proxy registers routes
  you->>hack: hack open
  hack->>browser: Open HTTPS address
  browser->>engine: HTTPS through proxy
  you->>hack: hack logs
  hack->>engine: Follow service logs
  engine-->>hack: Service output
  hack-->>you: Stream output
  Note over you,hack: Stop following with Ctrl-C
  you->>hack: hack down
  hack->>engine: Stop project services
  Note over hack,engine: Data stays retained
